Package: lumen
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6
Description: agent-friendly command launcher for KDE Plasma
 Lumen acts as a unified command surface for the desktop, allowing users to
 interact with applications, custom commands, nested submenus, system actions,
 common folders, calculator expressions, clipboard, and recent items with
 instant keyboard-driven feedback.
